      "content": "wait aspirin and ibuprofen together?? i thought you aren't supposed to mix those cuz of stomach issues. also if it's something like an aneurysm, isn't that kinda serious? i'm kinda scared now. do you really think i can just just handle this at home with vitamins and rest?",
